# Agent handoff continuity

Use when shipping a PR/wave, starting a new multi-session effort, or the user asks for continuity.

## When to update `docs/sdlc/agent-handoff.md`

- At **PR or wave boundaries** (not every small chat).
- Keep **current state only**: snapshot, next 1–3 tasks, blockers, short successor prompt.
- Cap ~250 lines; archive narrative elsewhere if needed.

## Package agents

Prefer a **Handoff delta** section in the PR body over editing handoff mid-wave unless you are the integration agent.

## PR template

Fill handoff/continuity sections when opening/updating a PR that continues multi-session work.
